16
00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:03.690
I'm watching all the superfan episodes, so it shows the deleted scenes, which I love.

17
00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:08.510
But during the deleted scene for Casino Night at 1 minute and 41 seconds,

18
00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:14.710
