19
00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:17.210
Angela, were you breaking character in that moment?

20
00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.070
Well, Rachel, you know what?

21
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:20.430
Thank you for writing in.

22
00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:21.390
I was really curious.

23
00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:27.250
I didn't remember that exact moment, so I went back and rewatched it, and I'm actually not breaking.

24
00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:34.190
I actually made the choice that Angela's being a little flirty and is delighted to be sitting next to Dwight,

25
00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:35.690
