26
00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:36.150
Okay.

27
00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.910
So this was flirty smile, not breaking smile.

28
00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:39.470
That's right.

29
00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:42.610
I mean, listen, anytime Angela smiles, we have to wonder.

30
00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:43.290
I know.

31
00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:49.270
Oh, and I never was given permission, really, to, like, laugh or smile, so when I did, I got very excited.

