44
00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.270
And I wondered, when did he make that move?

45
00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:35.130
And I always imagine that he took Jan up on her offer.

46
00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:37.050
Well, he has that talking head.

47
