I'm sure he did to get his things.

54
00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.610
So, I'm sure there was, like, an awkward few days.

55
00:02:56.610 --> 00:03:00.790
But I think he was out of there pretty quickly.

56
00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.710
That's my feeling.

57
00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:04.070
That tracks for me, too.

58
00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:08.190
I think the other question that I really wondered about was, like,

