00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.830
when in that timeline did Pam call off the wedding?

60
00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:12.790
Yeah.

61
00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:17.350
Was it after Jim left and how long after and...

