Oh, well, there's so many for you, Jenna.

77
00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:03.250
I mean, you have so many great moments as Pam.

78
00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:13.750
I always think about that talking head when Jim pops in and asks you out to dinner and everything

