89
00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:05.850
By each other.

90
00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:06.650
Oh, I see.

91
00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:07.150
I see.

92
00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:16.430
And the one that popped into my mind was the duel because I remember you having to sort of

93
