like hold all of us in the bullpen with your speech.

94
00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:22.370
Right.

95
00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:31.170
And I remember watching that and like being distracted by the fact that like you were being

96
00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:35.690
like the Steve Carell of that day, you know, and just be like, oh my gosh, I can't wait

97
00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.530
for my friend to see herself in this moment.

98
00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:39.950
Oh, I love that.

99
00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:45.430
Honestly, like when we were in the big bullpen and there were the scenes where Pam would take

100
