Like, but I would have to check myself because I'd be like, oh, that's so good.

104
00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.790
I'm like totally lost in the moment.

105
00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:08.250
But yeah, I loved it when Pam, like when you as Pam like went up against someone, whether

106
00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:12.530
it was Michael or Ryan or Dwight, and it was always a big group scene, whether it was the

107
00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:13.670
conference room or bullpen.

108
00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:17.670
And you just held your own and did your thing.

109
00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.290
It was always so fun to watch.

110
00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:19.950
Aw.

111
00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:23.570
Well, hey, thanks, Fiona, for letting us reminisce.

112
00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.270
That's all I got, folks.

