off of a gutter in a sort of waterfall-esque way?

145
00:07:56.340 --> 00:07:58.680
Apparently, that's what happens outside of my closet.

146
00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.260
So I'm in my daughter's closet.

147
00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:07.200
Well, I'm in my That's What She Shed because all three kids are inside and they're so loud.

