00:56:43.810 --> 00:56:45.130
Oh boy.

1281
00:56:45.490 --> 00:56:46.470
What were our bits?

1282
00:56:46.950 --> 00:56:47.890
What were our bits?

1283
00:56:48.110 --> 00:56:49.370
