00:57:27.810 --> 00:57:28.590
I'm like warm.

1293
00:57:28.590 --> 00:57:29.710
I'm sweating.

1294
00:57:30.150 --> 00:57:33.190
I'm like, oh my God, I'm like, it was so hot.

1295
00:57:33.350 --> 00:57:36.010
And we had to turn off the AC for sound.

1296
00:57:36.630 --> 00:57:38.570
And you were like, yeah, I don't know.

1297
00:57:38.650 --> 00:57:40.410
I'm okay, but you're hot, huh?

1298
00:57:40.530 --> 00:57:42.730
And I'm like, I'm so hot.

1299
00:57:43.130 --> 00:57:44.610
This went on for like 15 minutes.

1300
00:57:44.610 --> 00:57:51.690
And then all of a sudden you start snickering and you had turned on my seat warmer all the

1301
00:57:51.690 --> 00:57:53.690
way to the hottest setting.

1302
00:57:54.230 --> 00:57:54.890
Oh my God.

1303
00:57:54.970 --> 00:57:56.290
That was late in the run, wasn't it?

1304
00:57:56.370 --> 00:57:57.690
That was late in the run.

1305
00:57:57.870 --> 00:58:02.090
And I, but I was so excited because whenever we would go on talk shows, they would always

1306
00:58:02.090 --> 00:58:04.550
