1307
00:58:04.690 --> 00:58:06.370
And I would always say no.

1308
00:58:06.510 --> 00:58:07.450
And I mean, not really.

1309
00:58:07.450 --> 00:58:14.650
I mean, besides just like little jokes on post-it notes or something, not really, we weren't

1310
00:58:14.650 --> 00:58:15.610
pranky, you know?

1311
00:58:15.770 --> 00:58:20.250
But then finally, after you did that in the car, I was like, oh my gosh, this is great.

1312
00:58:20.530 --> 00:58:23.670
I can finally have a prank to talk about.

1313
00:58:24.830 --> 00:58:26.510
And you know what's sad about that prank?

1314
00:58:26.670 --> 00:58:28.010
What's sad about that prank?

1315
