1317
00:58:35.670 --> 00:58:36.730
He did that to me.

1318
00:58:37.170 --> 00:58:39.250
So that's how unoriginal I am.

1319
00:58:39.370 --> 00:58:42.950
I was like, I'm going to take George Clooney's bat and do it to Jenna.

1320
00:58:43.190 --> 00:58:44.650
And I thought that would make me cool.

1321
00:58:44.910 --> 00:58:45.090
Yeah.

1322
00:58:45.130 --> 00:58:46.430
So basically you're that.

1323
00:58:46.730 --> 00:58:49.370
You got, you got Clooney is what you got.

1324
00:58:49.410 --> 00:58:51.430
I did one degree of separation.

1325
00:58:51.790 --> 00:58:54.610
I think that prank just keeps getting cooler like that.

1326
00:58:54.890 --> 00:58:56.110
That's pretty fancy.

1327
00:58:56.250 --> 00:58:56.910
I think so too.

1328
00:58:57.050 --> 00:58:57.150
Yeah.

1329
00:58:57.230 --> 00:58:57.910
That's a good prank.

1330
00:58:58.010 --> 00:59:00.710
Let's get into the meat of your interview here, John.

