01:01:57.170 --> 01:02:00.610
I'd been there for like an hour or two hours and all the other people were the LA people.

1392
01:02:00.750 --> 01:02:02.790
And they, I realized they had separated us.

1393
01:02:02.910 --> 01:02:05.330
And so they were asking the New York people to leave after they were done.

1394
01:02:05.990 --> 01:02:10.930
And then I was the last New York person and I saw all these LA people in and I started

1395
01:02:10.930 --> 01:02:12.510
