1396
01:02:12.790 --> 01:02:14.590
I am, I am not a confident person.

1397
01:02:14.590 --> 01:02:16.690
And I was like, Oh my God, this is so embarrassing.

1398
01:02:16.690 --> 01:02:17.830
I'm the only New Yorker here.

1399
01:02:17.930 --> 01:02:21.310
Cause everybody was like, Hey, Johnny, Tim, like greeting each other.

1400
01:02:21.390 --> 01:02:22.690
And I was sitting on a floor.

1401
01:02:22.850 --> 01:02:26.850
Like, so I went on to the set cause all the producers were hiding in the background.

1402
01:02:27.750 --> 01:02:28.810
And I said, I'm so sorry.

1403
01:02:28.890 --> 01:02:30.550
I think someone forgot to tell me to go home.

1404
01:02:30.550 --> 01:02:37.130
Um, and from behind a like fake wall, I remember hearing like a lot of chair moving and stuff

1405
