And he was like, Nope.

1408
01:02:43.290 --> 01:02:43.730
Hold on one second.

1409
01:02:44.130 --> 01:02:44.990
Hold on one second, please.

1410
01:02:45.150 --> 01:02:45.690
Hold on one second.

1411
01:02:45.790 --> 01:02:48.590
And I heard Terry Weinberg being like, no, no, no, no, no, don't, don't go.

1412
01:02:49.230 --> 01:02:52.330
And then I went back out to the waiting room, super freaked out.

1413
01:02:52.790 --> 01:02:58.670
And I saw Jenna walk in the door and she was like, as soon as I saw you walk in, Jenna,

1414
01:02:58.670 --> 01:03:00.070
