1415
01:03:00.190 --> 01:03:01.270
So people are like, we get it.

1416
01:03:01.350 --> 01:03:02.410
We've seen behind the scenes.

1417
01:03:03.750 --> 01:03:09.150
Um, I, I genuinely have like a metaphysical event where I was like, Oh, that's who's in

1418
01:03:09.150 --> 01:03:09.450
the show.

1419
01:03:09.610 --> 01:03:10.810
That person will be in the show.

1420
01:03:11.230 --> 01:03:12.470
And so they held me back.

1421
01:03:12.590 --> 01:03:13.930
You went in with a bunch of people.

1422
01:03:14.730 --> 01:03:18.790
And I remember thinking, if I don't go in with her, I'm screwed.

1423
01:03:19.290 --> 01:03:21.550
And that's when I went on the thing and said, you should let me go.

1424
01:03:21.670 --> 01:03:22.210
And they said, no, no, no.

