1431
01:03:39.850 --> 01:03:46.870
I, it was, I've tried to describe it to people like what it was like to audition with you.

1432
01:03:47.970 --> 01:03:54.150
And the best, like the best explanation I could come up with was like, what if you walked

1433
01:03:54.150 --> 01:04:00.350
into a room and music started playing and you and another person just started dancing in unison,

1434
01:04:00.670 --> 01:04:04.450
even though you'd never met, that's what it was like auditioning with you.

1435
01:04:04.690 --> 01:04:04.770
Wow.

1436
01:04:04.870 --> 01:04:08.850
That's really way more beautiful than what I would say, which is like, I felt like I could see the

1437
01:04:08.850 --> 01:04:09.230
future.

1438
01:04:10.090 --> 01:04:15.870
I was like, it actually gave me, um, anxiety because I was like, she's so on the show.

1439
01:04:16.490 --> 01:04:18.830
It's so weird that I'm like watching a piece get in.

1440
01:04:19.070 --> 01:04:23.590
And I remember, I'm sure you remember too, but when, after our audition and I loved auditioning

1441
01:04:23.590 --> 01:04:27.970
