1442
01:04:28.090 --> 01:04:29.850
And I said, um, I just gotta let you know.

1443
01:04:29.970 --> 01:04:31.050
I think that you're going to get this part.

1444
01:04:31.050 --> 01:04:31.910
You're perfect for this.

