01:04:32.290 --> 01:04:34.970
And you, you seem to remember, you said the same thing to me.

1446
01:04:34.970 --> 01:04:36.250
I don't cause I blacked out.

1447
01:04:36.410 --> 01:04:37.890
I was trying to not let you in the eyes.

1448
01:04:38.390 --> 01:04:39.790
I was so excited.

1449
01:04:40.070 --> 01:04:45.350
I, that you said that because I felt like I had wanted to say that to you, but I didn't have the

1450
01:04:45.350 --> 01:04:47.630
