1451
01:04:47.750 --> 01:04:49.670
You were like essentially a stranger to me.

1452
01:04:49.790 --> 01:04:53.750
The only time we had really spoken or interacted was during our audition.

1453
01:04:54.190 --> 01:04:58.830
So we were kind of silently walking back to the kitchen and I was thinking in my head,

1454
01:04:59.390 --> 01:04:59.990
should I tell him?

1455
01:05:00.050 --> 01:05:01.010
I think he's the best gym.

