01:05:02.070 --> 01:05:03.190
Should I say you're the best gym?

1458
01:05:03.190 --> 01:05:06.330
Um, you're going to be gym or is that, is that bad form?

1459
01:05:06.470 --> 01:05:06.870
I don't know.

1460
01:05:06.970 --> 01:05:07.630
What's the etiquette.

