01:05:10.670 --> 01:05:13.530
My memory is that I was like, Oh my God, I think you're going to be gym.

1463
01:05:13.610 --> 01:05:14.070
You're the best gym.

1464
01:05:14.190 --> 01:05:15.030
You're my favorite gym.

1465
01:05:15.290 --> 01:05:15.710
Like that.

1466
01:05:15.790 --> 01:05:16.810
I was just like blurted.

1467
01:05:16.910 --> 01:05:19.250
I had like, that's just, yeah, I was having a nosebleed at that time.

1468
01:05:19.370 --> 01:05:20.110
Don't remember much.

1469
01:05:20.270 --> 01:05:26.330
Um, but I do remember this though, that, you know, I always say this and people are like,

1470
01:05:26.410 --> 01:05:27.910
yeah, whatever, but it's true.

1471
01:05:29.470 --> 01:05:34.150
I have a lottery ticket life ever since I was given the news that I was on that show.

1472
01:05:34.330 --> 01:05:39.470
Everything changed in my life for every single way, not to get into a heady version, but like

1473
01:05:39.470 --> 01:05:42.810
