1476
01:05:48.530 --> 01:05:51.330
It was, it's just so crazy how deep and crazy it goes.

1477
01:05:51.450 --> 01:05:57.310
But I remember at the epicenter of it all, when I was told that I had the part, I actually

1478
01:05:57.310 --> 01:06:02.690
