1981
01:29:11.000 --> 01:29:11.720
Oh, wow.

1982
01:29:11.720 --> 01:29:15.580
And don't speak to John and just be alone.

1983
01:29:16.080 --> 01:29:18.440
And so it was super secret.

1984
01:29:19.440 --> 01:29:19.960
Yes.

