1998
01:29:55.260 --> 01:29:57.000
Someone was like, what is happening?

1999
01:29:57.840 --> 01:29:58.240
I know.

2000
01:29:58.340 --> 01:30:01.120
My memory is that that was the last thing we did that day.

2001
01:30:01.120 --> 01:30:02.120
Me too.

2002
01:30:02.380 --> 01:30:05.140
And Brian was like, 1,000% not.

2003
01:30:05.320 --> 01:30:09.280
All of us were in our trailers being like, you've got to be kidding me with these two.

2004
01:30:10.220 --> 01:30:10.940
Oh, no.

2005
01:30:11.640 --> 01:30:12.320
Oh, no.

2006
01:30:12.520 --> 01:30:14.260
I thought it was the end of the day.

2007
01:30:14.420 --> 01:30:16.280
And we had all the time in the world.

2008
01:30:16.440 --> 01:30:17.380
That's what I said to Brian.

2009
01:30:18.640 --> 01:30:19.420
Oh, my goodness.

2010
01:30:19.540 --> 01:30:19.880
He's right.

2011
