2062
01:32:15.780 --> 01:32:23.060
Well, Ken Quapis and Kent Zvornak both confirmed we only did three takes of this scene.

2063
01:32:23.280 --> 01:32:27.920
And Ken said that Greg wanted to keep doing it over and over and over again.

2064
