2074
01:32:46.100 --> 01:32:47.040
You can't say that.

2075
01:32:47.300 --> 01:32:47.700
Awkward.

2076
01:32:47.700 --> 01:32:48.120
What the?

2077
01:32:48.240 --> 01:32:48.640
Awkward.

2078
01:32:48.720 --> 01:32:49.600
